# fullrust support for mio 1.2.3 — route target_os = "fullrust" through mio's
# own unix backend (epoll selector, eventfd waker, net/tcp/udp, pipe, SourceFd)
# exactly as on Linux: cfg broadenings + a private raw-syscall `libc` shim
# (src/sys/unix/libc.rs) standing in for the libc crate. No libc dependency.
# UDS (UnixStream/Listener/Datagram) stays gated out: it wraps std::os::unix::net.
# Applied on top of crates.io mio 1.2.3 (vendored in crates/mio/).
